# Local Issue Tracker

Track engineering work as `docs/issues/ISSUE-NNNN-title.md`; do not use an online Issue tracker.

Allowed states are `proposed`, `ready`, `in-progress`, `blocked`, `done`, and `cancelled`. Keep Issue files at stable paths, update `docs/issues/README.md` after state changes, and append final outcomes to the current month under `docs/changelog/` when an Issue becomes `done` or `cancelled`.

Do not mark an Issue `done` until its acceptance checklist is complete and verification evidence is recorded.
